WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.400
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.670 --> 01:43.060
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.120 --> 01:43.700
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.700 --> 01:45.950
[Episode 6]

5
02:43.660 --> 02:46.540
[Murder Warning by the Black Chest]

6
02:55.120 --> 02:56.680
For many years, Northern Kun

7
02:56.680 --> 02:58.520
has had constant friction with our dynasty.

8
02:58.520 --> 03:00.180
Years ago, they marched south

9
03:00.400 --> 03:01.400
and confronted Prince Ping's border army

10
03:01.400 --> 03:02.840
for months.

11
03:03.120 --> 03:04.590
The delegation came this time

12
03:04.590 --> 03:05.960
in the name of exchanging credentials

13
03:05.960 --> 03:07.080
to seek a truce.

14
03:07.190 --> 03:08.840
In fact, they intend to

15
03:08.840 --> 03:10.570
spy on our dynasty's strength.

16
03:10.710 --> 03:11.710
I propose

17
03:11.860 --> 03:13.310
that we should let Wenbu

18
03:13.360 --> 03:15.120
see our army's ceremonial drill

19
03:15.120 --> 03:16.850
to show our national prestige.

20
03:16.960 --> 03:17.910
Meanwhile,

21
03:18.020 --> 03:22.160
[The Eldest Prince of the Shi Empire, Prince Ding Zhou Miao]

22
03:18.150 --> 03:20.870
tell Prince Ping to stand ready at the border

23
03:21.120 --> 03:23.320
to prevent Northern Kun from invading.

24
03:25.360 --> 03:26.160
Your Majesty,

25
03:26.230 --> 03:27.140
I think

26
03:27.190 --> 03:28.680
there's no need for such trouble.

27
03:28.680 --> 03:30.410
In dealing with such barbarians,

28
03:30.410 --> 03:31.270
there's no need to be polite.

29
03:31.270 --> 03:32.590
Just detain Wenbu,

30
03:32.620 --> 03:34.350
and they won't dare to send troops rashly.

31
03:34.350 --> 03:36.950
The border crisis will naturally be resolved.

32
03:37.360 --> 03:39.590
Miao, you must understand that

33
03:40.000 --> 03:42.430
Wenbu is the Crown Prince of Northern Kun.

34
03:42.520 --> 03:43.750
A Crown Prince

35
03:44.270 --> 03:46.000
is the foundation of a country.

36
03:46.310 --> 03:47.630
He's the key.

37
03:47.910 --> 03:48.870
He is not someone

38
03:49.680 --> 03:51.960
that a low-born illegitimate prince

39
03:51.960 --> 03:52.960
or any random nobody

40
03:52.960 --> 03:54.310
can compare to.

41
03:59.710 --> 04:01.000
As far as I know,

42
04:01.190 --> 04:01.960
this Wenbu

43
04:01.960 --> 04:03.960
has been traveling through our Great Shi,

44
04:03.960 --> 04:06.890
indulging in wine and women and acting shamelessly.

45
04:07.500 --> 04:09.820
Such a coward

46
04:10.130 --> 04:11.960
may have the title of Crown Prince,

47
04:11.960 --> 04:13.030
but he only relies on

48
04:13.030 --> 04:15.190
his mother being the legitimate wife.

49
04:15.210 --> 04:17.040
In fact, he is good for nothing.

50
04:17.750 --> 04:18.600
In my opinion,

51
04:19.310 --> 04:21.040
the Khan of Northern Kun may not,

52
04:21.040 --> 04:22.950
for this useless son,

53
04:23.070 --> 04:25.600
give up his grand ambition.

54
04:28.750 --> 04:29.360
Miao—

55
04:29.360 --> 04:30.600
The Crown Prince said

56
04:31.750 --> 04:32.950
to detain Wenbu.

57
04:33.600 --> 04:34.870
The First Prince said

58
04:35.720 --> 04:38.320
we should prepare for war to show our prestige.

59
04:43.750 --> 04:44.950
Grand Secretary Bai,

60
04:45.950 --> 04:47.720
what do you have to say?

61
04:48.290 --> 04:50.409
[Bai Qi, Senior Grand Secretary]

62
04:54.750 --> 04:55.560
That year,

63
04:56.310 --> 04:58.360
I followed the late Emperor Wuzong of Shi

64
04:58.360 --> 04:59.560
to attack Liluo.

65
04:59.750 --> 05:00.920
Sleeping in the mountains,

66
05:00.920 --> 05:02.270
I suddenly heard wolves howling

67
05:02.270 --> 05:03.750
outside the tent at night.

68
05:04.310 --> 05:05.950
I was very scared,

69
05:06.390 --> 05:08.870
but I didn't dare to go out and see what was going on.

70
05:08.870 --> 05:10.800
The sound got closer and closer,

71
05:10.800 --> 05:11.920
closer and closer,

72
05:11.920 --> 05:14.270
and I got more and more scared.

73
05:14.600 --> 05:16.460
Until that thing came to the tent,

74
05:16.800 --> 05:18.190
I suddenly remembered

75
05:18.310 --> 05:19.440
that inside my tent,

76
05:19.560 --> 05:22.560
there were still over a dozen armored soldiers standing.

77
05:22.560 --> 05:23.760
Grand Secretary Bai,

78
05:24.070 --> 05:25.070
what does this

79
05:25.600 --> 05:28.060
have to do with the Northern Kun delegation?

80
05:28.120 --> 05:29.390
What I mean is,

81
05:29.560 --> 05:31.120
when others are in our territory,

82
05:31.120 --> 05:33.920
they should be the ones facing a formidable enemy,

83
05:33.950 --> 05:35.480
not us.

84
05:38.120 --> 05:39.320
Grand Secretary Bai,

85
05:39.750 --> 05:42.270
are you done with the story?

86
05:43.000 --> 05:44.040
Later we found out

87
05:44.070 --> 05:45.130
it wasn't a jackal,

88
05:45.190 --> 05:46.600
just a wild dog,

89
05:46.600 --> 05:48.200
and a very well-behaved one.

90
05:49.560 --> 05:50.360
Good.

91
05:51.390 --> 05:52.560
If it's a dog,

92
05:53.159 --> 05:54.830
we treat it with courtesy.

93
05:54.950 --> 05:56.040
If it's a jackal,

94
05:56.190 --> 05:58.360
we have soldiers too.

95
05:58.720 --> 06:00.190
Let's wait and see.

96
06:00.430 --> 06:01.240
Good.

97
06:02.270 --> 06:04.310
Send word to the Northern Kun delegation.

98
06:04.310 --> 06:05.840
They've had a hard journey.

99
06:05.920 --> 06:07.600
Let them rest at the Envoy Residence.

100
06:07.600 --> 06:09.260
Treat them with state honors.

101
06:10.270 --> 06:11.430
Do not neglect them.

102
06:11.950 --> 06:13.970
-Yes, Your Majesty. -Yes, Your Majesty.

103
06:13.970 --> 06:16.070
[Envoy Residence]

104
06:14.720 --> 06:16.560
The Divine Constable Bureau will send elites

105
06:16.560 --> 06:18.070
to guard the Envoy Residence.

106
06:17.270 --> 06:19.620
[Envoy Residence]

107
06:18.560 --> 06:20.190
There must be no mistakes.

108
06:25.110 --> 06:28.960
[Envoy Residence]

109
06:29.680 --> 06:31.560
Your Highness, mind the steps.

110
06:32.040 --> 06:33.680
These are gifts from various officials

111
06:33.680 --> 06:35.680
to you.

112
06:38.750 --> 06:40.600
This is an ancient jade fossil,

113
06:40.600 --> 06:42.000
extremely rare and precious.

114
06:42.000 --> 06:42.560
Look,

115
06:42.560 --> 06:43.750
there are so many

116
06:43.750 --> 06:44.950
rare treasures here.

117
06:50.170 --> 06:51.050
What is this?

118
06:51.270 --> 06:52.159
Strange.

119
06:52.190 --> 06:54.390
This black chest isn't on the gift list.

120
07:43.720 --> 07:45.190
Your Highness, are you alright?

121
07:45.190 --> 07:46.320
You call this a gift?

122
07:46.800 --> 07:48.270
Such an ominous object.

123
07:48.720 --> 07:50.240
This is clearly a curse,

124
07:50.350 --> 07:52.159
a provocation to Northern Kun!

125
07:52.360 --> 07:53.600
Please calm down, My Lord!

126
07:53.600 --> 07:54.630
I really didn't know!

127
07:54.630 --> 07:55.830
This item is not on the Ministry of Rites

128
07:55.830 --> 07:56.720
gift list!

129
07:56.720 --> 07:57.490
How dare you!

130
07:57.950 --> 07:58.920
Your Highness!

131
07:59.190 --> 07:59.950
Stop!

132
08:10.720 --> 08:12.630
Prince Wenbu, please behave yourself.

133
08:12.630 --> 08:13.830
Inside Tianhuang City,

134
08:13.830 --> 08:14.920
you cannot draw weapons so easily.

135
08:14.920 --> 08:16.920
The Divine Constable Bureau again.

136
08:17.160 --> 08:18.750
Do you people from the Divine Constable Bureau

137
08:18.750 --> 08:20.680
enjoy going against me?

138
08:44.000 --> 08:45.510
Please let Lord Zhang go.

139
08:45.910 --> 08:47.150
The Divine Constable Bureau

140
08:47.150 --> 08:49.480
will definitely give you an explanation.

141
08:52.150 --> 08:53.120
Your Highness,

142
08:53.600 --> 08:55.730
this is Great Shi territory after all.

143
08:56.150 --> 08:58.790
Why not give them a chance?

144
08:59.150 --> 09:00.630
If they can't find out,

145
09:01.000 --> 09:02.800
it won't be too late for us to act.

146
09:08.360 --> 09:09.150
Fine.

147
09:09.720 --> 09:11.270
I'll give you a deadline.

148
09:12.390 --> 09:13.790
If the time passes

149
09:13.790 --> 09:14.840
and you still haven't found out,

150
09:14.840 --> 09:17.030
don't blame me for taking action.

151
09:17.790 --> 09:20.200
One day is enough.

152
09:20.840 --> 09:22.100
What are you thinking?

153
09:23.000 --> 09:23.910
I

154
09:24.120 --> 09:27.750
will only give you the time of one dance.

155
09:28.590 --> 09:30.070
Come, play the music!

156
09:30.480 --> 09:31.760
Dance!

157
10:18.940 --> 10:25.060
[Clear as a Mirror]

158
10:22.320 --> 10:25.360
Work carefully, all of you!

159
10:39.200 --> 10:40.630
Especially the new guy!

160
10:41.320 --> 10:42.510
Work hard!

161
10:42.630 --> 10:43.670
Don't slack off!

162
11:18.720 --> 11:20.080
Wipe that clean

163
11:20.150 --> 11:21.000
and put it up.

164
11:23.600 --> 11:24.360
Mr. Qi.

165
11:24.600 --> 11:25.360
Mr. Li.

166
11:25.870 --> 11:26.670
I see

167
11:27.240 --> 11:29.240
these weapons are very unique.

168
11:29.240 --> 11:30.030
I wonder

169
11:30.910 --> 11:32.110
what their origin is.

170
11:32.720 --> 11:34.320
That's a long story.

171
11:34.630 --> 11:35.600
These are all

172
11:35.600 --> 11:37.330
the weapons of the past Chiefs.

173
11:37.600 --> 11:38.720
This Zhanjieyu

174
11:38.720 --> 11:39.670
is the sword of the first Chief,

175
11:39.670 --> 11:40.910
Ling Wufeng.

176
11:44.550 --> 11:46.810
That Fufengqie is even more impressive.

177
11:46.960 --> 11:48.550
The second Chief, Chu Xuanji,

178
11:47.700 --> 11:49.930
[Chu Xuanji, Second Chief] [Fufengqie]

179
11:48.790 --> 11:51.550
held this sword to intimidate all evil.

180
11:55.670 --> 11:56.440
Our Divine Constable Bureau

181
11:56.440 --> 11:57.790
is indeed mighty.

182
11:57.910 --> 11:58.870
Isn't it?

183
12:13.910 --> 12:15.000
This Chief Constable's Hall

184
12:15.000 --> 12:17.360
is the office of the past Chiefs.

185
12:18.150 --> 12:21.360
It's surrounded by the patterns of the nine sons of the dragon.

186
12:21.360 --> 12:23.000
This bronze statue of the Bi'an divine beast

187
12:23.000 --> 12:25.120
crawls on the dome right in the middle,

188
12:25.120 --> 12:27.320
symbolizing the strictness of the law.

189
12:29.030 --> 12:30.150
I see.

190
12:33.270 --> 12:34.080
Mr. Qi.

191
12:35.960 --> 12:38.240
After we finish cleaning this hall

192
12:38.240 --> 12:39.550
later,

193
12:40.360 --> 12:41.150
can we

194
12:41.150 --> 12:42.880
go clean the Tianshu Pavilion?

195
12:45.510 --> 12:47.120
What kind of place is the Tianshu Pavilion?

196
12:47.120 --> 12:48.510
Not even dust can fly in.

197
12:48.510 --> 12:50.240
Do you think it needs cleaning?

198
12:50.360 --> 12:51.790
Not even dust can fly in?

199
12:52.120 --> 12:53.670
How did that person get in?

200
12:54.000 --> 12:55.400
He is a Divine Constable.

201
12:57.790 --> 12:59.190
He just took out his token

202
13:02.790 --> 13:03.630
and went in.

203
13:08.910 --> 13:09.720
Then...

204
13:10.200 --> 13:12.330
how can one become a Divine Constable?

205
13:12.630 --> 13:14.840
You are a trainee constable now.

206
13:15.150 --> 13:16.910
If you endure for 3 years without making mistakes,

207
13:16.910 --> 13:18.080
you can be promoted.

208
13:19.670 --> 13:20.480
Three years?

209
13:20.790 --> 13:21.600
After 3 years,

210
13:21.600 --> 13:23.000
you will be a third-class constable,

211
13:23.000 --> 13:23.790
just like me.

212
13:24.030 --> 13:25.440
You won't have to clean the latrine anymore,

213
13:25.440 --> 13:26.840
but can be a porter

214
13:26.960 --> 13:28.750
and participate in some simple cases.

215
13:28.750 --> 13:29.630
Another 5 years,

216
13:29.630 --> 13:30.360
and you can become

217
13:30.360 --> 13:31.630
a second-class constable.

218
13:31.630 --> 13:32.840
But after becoming a second-class constable,

219
13:32.840 --> 13:34.150
you can't just bide your time.

220
13:34.150 --> 13:36.440
You have to accumulate merits and solve cases.

221
13:36.440 --> 13:37.910
Becoming a first-class constable

222
13:37.910 --> 13:39.000
depends on luck.

223
13:39.000 --> 13:40.550
Generally speaking, in the Divine Constable Bureau,

224
13:40.550 --> 13:41.790
constables with more than 20 years of experience

225
13:41.790 --> 13:42.990
are all first-class.

226
13:48.720 --> 13:50.120
Head Constable Yao is a first-class constable.

227
13:50.120 --> 13:51.240
It's just that he's old now.

228
13:51.240 --> 13:52.200
His legs are not good,

229
13:52.200 --> 13:53.730
and he can't go to the scene.

230
14:02.910 --> 14:03.720
Mr. Qi.

231
14:04.150 --> 14:06.010
Above the first-class constable

232
14:06.120 --> 14:07.200
is the Divine Constable, right?

233
14:07.200 --> 14:08.000
No.

234
14:08.440 --> 14:09.720
Above the first-class constable

235
14:09.720 --> 14:10.750
is the third-class head constable,

236
14:10.750 --> 14:11.630
then the second-class head constable,

237
14:11.630 --> 14:12.720
then the first-class head constable,

238
14:12.720 --> 14:13.440
and then the chief head constable.

239
14:13.440 --> 14:14.150
Stop.

240
14:16.790 --> 14:17.850
Then let me ask you.

241
14:18.360 --> 14:20.750
Ms. Bai, Mr. Meng,

242
14:20.790 --> 14:21.790
and Lord Lou—

243
14:21.790 --> 14:22.790
why are they Divine Constables

244
14:22.790 --> 14:24.000
at such a young age?

245
14:24.510 --> 14:25.390
That's because

246
14:25.390 --> 14:28.990
the Divine Constables have all solved earth-shattering cases.

247
14:29.000 --> 14:30.460
Earth-shattering cases?

248
15:44.600 --> 15:45.510
Your Highness!

249
15:45.840 --> 15:46.870
What should we do?

250
15:56.030 --> 15:56.430
[Benevolence and Neighborly Amity]

251
16:05.000 --> 16:06.270
What's this whistle for?

252
16:06.270 --> 16:08.510
It's the order of the Divine Constable Bureau.

253
16:08.510 --> 16:09.440
It means that

254
16:09.510 --> 16:10.960
no matter what case we are handling

255
16:10.960 --> 16:11.910
and what stage it is at,

256
16:11.910 --> 16:13.120
we must stop temporarily

257
16:13.120 --> 16:14.780
and gather at the crime scene.

258
16:14.910 --> 16:15.960
That is to say,

259
16:16.480 --> 16:18.120
just like nature calls,

260
16:18.660 --> 16:20.030
no matter how busy we are,

261
16:20.030 --> 16:21.360
we have to put it on hold.

262
16:21.370 --> 16:24.030
This is the earth-shattering case I mentioned.

263
16:34.320 --> 16:36.510
We want to see the Emperor of Great Shi

264
16:36.960 --> 16:38.420
to ask for an explanation.

265
16:39.320 --> 16:40.120
Step aside!

266
16:40.150 --> 16:41.100
-Step aside! -Step aside!

267
16:41.100 --> 16:42.560
-Step aside! -Step aside!

268
16:49.830 --> 16:51.560
-Head Constable Yan. -Mr. Yan.

269
16:51.910 --> 16:54.320
The Divine Constable Bureau has been established for 46 years.

270
16:54.320 --> 16:57.150
Among all the major cases

271
16:57.200 --> 16:58.000
and murder cases in Tianhuang City,

272
16:58.000 --> 17:00.000
is there any that we couldn't solve?

273
17:00.030 --> 17:01.840
-No! No! -No! No!

274
17:02.870 --> 17:05.200
But if someone takes the opportunity to cause trouble,

275
17:05.069 --> 17:07.900
[Yan Cheng, Constable Iron]

276
17:05.440 --> 17:08.270
can the Divine Constable Bureau let outsiders

277
17:08.680 --> 17:10.540
disturb the peace of the capital?

278
17:10.720 --> 17:12.670
-No! No! -No! No!

279
17:16.349 --> 17:17.839
You heard it.

280
17:18.480 --> 17:21.270
We will solve the murder case.

281
17:21.829 --> 17:22.680
You

282
17:23.310 --> 17:25.380
must stay in the Envoy Residence.

283
17:26.680 --> 17:28.310
You make it sound nice.

284
17:29.510 --> 17:30.910
Prince Wenbu was

285
17:30.930 --> 17:32.620
under the protection of the Divine Constable Bureau

286
17:32.620 --> 17:33.680
when he was killed.

287
17:33.790 --> 17:35.720
How can I trust you?

288
17:36.710 --> 17:39.170
How can I trust the Divine Constable Bureau?

289
18:00.310 --> 18:01.000
Yan,

290
18:01.000 --> 18:01.790
are you okay?

291
18:02.400 --> 18:03.200
I'm fine.

292
18:07.550 --> 18:08.550
It's you again.

293
18:09.960 --> 18:12.350
Yes, it's me again.

294
18:14.920 --> 18:15.720
Mr. Yan,

295
18:15.790 --> 18:16.920
didn't you go back to your hometown to visit your relatives?

296
18:16.920 --> 18:18.250
Why are you back so soon?

297
18:18.830 --> 18:19.550
As soon as I heard

298
18:19.550 --> 18:22.000
the news that the Northern Kun delegation entered the capital,

299
18:22.000 --> 18:23.350
I rushed back.

300
18:24.550 --> 18:25.480
You're new here?

301
18:26.400 --> 18:27.720
You're quite bold.

302
18:29.790 --> 18:31.070
I've always been bold.

303
18:31.070 --> 18:32.200
Trainee Constable!

304
18:34.510 --> 18:35.310
Step back.

305
18:36.200 --> 18:37.000
Yes.

306
18:37.830 --> 18:39.090
Divine Constable Lou.

307
18:39.790 --> 18:41.400
The men of Northern Kun

308
18:41.880 --> 18:43.270
only die in battle;

309
18:43.680 --> 18:44.940
they never fear death.

310
18:45.880 --> 18:47.350
I came here this time

311
18:47.750 --> 18:49.680
to bring His Majesty's oral edict.

312
18:49.720 --> 18:50.850
Listen to the edict!

313
18:53.830 --> 18:55.350
An oral decree from His Majesty:

314
18:55.350 --> 18:56.480
From this moment on,

315
18:56.590 --> 18:58.400
the nine gates of Tianhuang City are closed.

316
18:58.240 --> 19:00.930
[Tianhuang City]

317
19:00.510 --> 19:01.440
Scholars, farmers, artisans, merchants,

318
19:00.950 --> 19:02.050
[Proclamation]

319
19:01.510 --> 19:03.070
peddlers, and all other people,

320
19:02.070 --> 19:03.560
[Divine Constable Tally]

321
19:03.200 --> 19:05.200
as well as officials below the third rank,

322
19:05.200 --> 19:07.030
shall not enter or leave without an edict.

323
19:07.030 --> 19:09.240
The Divine Constable Bureau is ordered

324
19:09.350 --> 19:11.350
to bring the murderer to justice within 7 days.

325
19:11.350 --> 19:13.720
The Grand Secretariat and the Ministry of Justice officials

326
19:13.720 --> 19:16.030
must cooperate with the bureau to hunt down the murderer.

327
19:16.030 --> 19:17.240
No disobedience is allowed.

328
19:17.240 --> 19:17.900
-Yes! -Yes!

329
19:17.920 --> 19:18.710
-Yes! -Yes!

330
19:18.730 --> 19:19.530
-Yes! -Yes!

331
19:28.720 --> 19:29.510
Mr. Yan,

332
19:30.150 --> 19:32.070
the Emperor's word is unbreakable.

333
19:32.070 --> 19:33.720
His Majesty will definitely give Northern Kun

334
19:33.720 --> 19:35.590
and Prince Wenbu justice.

335
19:48.310 --> 19:49.030
Lord Yan.

336
19:49.510 --> 19:51.220
[Envoy Residence]

337
19:56.600 --> 19:57.240
That's hard to say.

338
19:57.240 --> 19:58.000
I don't know.

339
19:58.350 --> 19:59.070
Something happened

340
19:59.070 --> 20:00.240
right in this room.

341
20:00.240 --> 20:02.000
-Really? -Who is so bold?

342
20:02.200 --> 20:02.960
Prince Wenbu

343
20:02.960 --> 20:05.200
was murdered under the protection of the Divine Constable Bureau.

344
20:05.200 --> 20:06.440
Since the establishment of the Divine Constable Bureau

345
20:06.440 --> 20:07.480
46 years ago,

346
20:06.680 --> 20:09.280
[Divine Constable Bureau]

347
20:07.480 --> 20:08.400
there has never been

348
20:08.400 --> 20:10.000
such an appalling incident.

349
20:11.160 --> 20:12.290
Normally speaking,

350
20:12.480 --> 20:14.240
the Envoy Residence is heavily guarded.

351
20:14.240 --> 20:14.920
Not even a bird

352
20:14.920 --> 20:16.070
could fly in,

353
20:16.480 --> 20:18.540
let alone a stranger going in and out.

354
20:39.030 --> 20:41.100
The gifts for foreign guests should logically

355
20:41.100 --> 20:42.960
go through layers of inspection.

356
20:43.140 --> 20:44.950
How could the black chest

357
20:44.980 --> 20:47.110
appear out of thin air among the gifts?

358
20:47.200 --> 20:48.600
What's even stranger is,

359
20:48.760 --> 20:49.590
the chest seems to have

360
20:49.590 --> 20:50.790
foreseen the future,

361
20:50.790 --> 20:51.880
predicting the scene of

362
20:51.880 --> 20:53.110
Prince Wenbu's murder,

363
20:53.110 --> 20:55.110
with every detail exactly the same.

364
20:56.920 --> 20:58.400
Given the condition of the corpse,

365
20:58.400 --> 20:59.160
even Ms. Bai

366
20:59.160 --> 21:00.310
has never seen it before,

367
21:00.310 --> 21:01.880
let alone examined it.

368
21:07.070 --> 21:08.270
Jiang Zhan, Ding Mao.

369
21:08.680 --> 21:09.810
Go in and take a look.

370
21:22.920 --> 21:23.640
My Lord!

371
21:23.640 --> 21:24.400
What are you doing?

372
21:24.400 --> 21:25.480
Let me in!

373
21:25.480 --> 21:26.440
What kind of place do you think this is?

374
21:26.440 --> 21:27.970
My cousin is still inside!

375
21:28.000 --> 21:28.960
Young man.

376
21:29.070 --> 21:30.680
-Step back! Step back! -Please let me in,

377
21:30.680 --> 21:32.200
-okay? -Back off! Back off!

378
21:32.200 --> 21:33.400
Constable Eagle, Lord Lou,

379
21:33.400 --> 21:35.000
asked me to wait for you here.

380
21:35.400 --> 21:36.350
Lord Lou?

381
21:37.310 --> 21:38.920
You're just an unregistered runner.

382
21:38.920 --> 21:40.380
Why are you waiting for me?

383
21:41.110 --> 21:42.030
Young man,

384
21:42.480 --> 21:43.550
do you know how I

385
21:43.550 --> 21:45.030
got into the Divine Constable Bureau?

386
21:45.030 --> 21:46.230
Step back! Step back!

387
21:46.640 --> 21:47.600
Because

388
21:47.680 --> 21:49.510
I have good handwriting.

389
21:50.310 --> 21:52.920
The so-called sweeping armies with a pen

390
21:53.110 --> 21:54.770
and writing with iron strokes

391
21:54.920 --> 21:56.240
refer to me.

392
21:56.920 --> 21:59.030
So at this scene,

393
21:59.200 --> 22:01.130
any copying and transcribing work

394
22:01.200 --> 22:02.680
is my responsibility.

395
22:04.920 --> 22:06.050
Then come in with me.

396
22:06.400 --> 22:07.200
Alright.

397
22:15.270 --> 22:18.160
Sorting and classifying may seem boring,

398
22:18.910 --> 22:21.220
but it actually cultivates the mind

399
22:21.310 --> 22:22.680
and trains the eyes.

400
22:24.920 --> 22:26.590
I can also practice my handwriting.

401
22:26.590 --> 22:27.680
Isn't it wonderful?

402
22:27.480 --> 22:30.280
[Class A‑2, Gem & Tribute Gifts]

403
22:30.300 --> 22:30.650
[Class A‑2, Gem & Tribute Gifts] [Class C‑1, Gem & Tribute Gifts]

404
22:30.920 --> 22:31.680
Friend.

405
22:32.640 --> 22:33.570
Watch your step.

406
22:36.560 --> 22:37.460
Be careful.

407
22:47.880 --> 22:49.160
I think if I keep this up

408
22:49.200 --> 22:50.510
for 100 years,

409
22:51.000 --> 22:53.260
I can become the fifth Divine Constable.

410
22:53.310 --> 22:54.070
Lord Yan.

411
22:56.920 --> 22:57.830
Lord Yan.

412
23:03.640 --> 23:04.440
Yan.

413
23:05.030 --> 23:05.830
Your hand...

414
23:06.400 --> 23:07.200
I'm fine.

415
23:07.480 --> 23:08.270
How is it?

416
23:10.310 --> 23:11.110
The corpse...

417
23:11.680 --> 23:13.280
Corpse fluid is hard to test.

418
23:13.510 --> 23:15.000
But judging from the smell,

419
23:15.000 --> 23:16.510
it's the poison called Yama's Call—

420
23:16.510 --> 23:17.640
"Yama wants you dead at midnight;

421
23:17.640 --> 23:18.590
who dares keep you until dawn?"—

422
23:18.590 --> 23:20.920
or the Seven-Step Corpse-Dissolving Powder.

423
23:20.920 --> 23:21.720
This thing

424
23:21.920 --> 23:23.380
must be hard to get, right?

425
23:24.640 --> 23:26.310
Not only are the ingredients extremely rare,

426
23:26.310 --> 23:27.790
but the refining process

427
23:27.790 --> 23:28.720
is extremely dangerous.

428
23:28.720 --> 23:29.400
One careless mistake,

429
23:29.400 --> 23:30.920
and you might dissolve yourself.

430
23:30.920 --> 23:31.590
It's said that

431
23:31.590 --> 23:33.070
among the masters who refine Yama's Call,

432
23:33.070 --> 23:35.070
9 out of 10 have missing fingers

433
23:35.070 --> 23:36.350
or are blind.

434
23:38.200 --> 23:39.510
That makes it easy.

435
23:40.310 --> 23:41.710
We'll ask them one by one.

436
23:41.920 --> 23:43.720
Interrogate all the black market medicine sellers,

437
23:43.720 --> 23:44.830
and we'll know

438
23:44.920 --> 23:46.680
who the buyer is.

439
23:46.830 --> 23:48.510
Leave this to me.

440
23:48.920 --> 23:50.310
A few lashes of the whip,

441
23:50.310 --> 23:51.510
and they'll confess everything.

442
23:51.510 --> 23:52.310
No need.

443
23:52.790 --> 23:53.830
As far as I know,

444
23:54.000 --> 23:54.790
in this Tianhuang City,

445
23:54.790 --> 23:56.240
the only bottle of Yama's Call

446
23:56.240 --> 23:58.480
is in the coroner's room of the Divine Constable Bureau.

447
23:58.480 --> 23:59.440
In your room.

448
24:00.070 --> 24:01.350
That's impossible.

449
24:01.830 --> 24:02.880
Our Divine Constable Bureau

450
24:02.880 --> 24:04.340
is already a den of tigers.

451
24:04.880 --> 24:05.920
Your room

452
24:06.680 --> 24:08.080
is even more terrifying.

453
24:10.000 --> 24:10.960
Why is he here?

454
24:13.340 --> 24:14.400
After all, he was personally recruited

455
24:14.400 --> 24:15.680
by the Chief.

456
24:15.680 --> 24:17.140
We have to look out for him.

457
24:17.510 --> 24:19.200
Since there are no clues elsewhere,

458
24:19.200 --> 24:21.240
we should start by interrogating people.

459
24:21.240 --> 24:23.070
The last ones to approach Prince Wenbu

460
24:23.070 --> 24:24.400
should be a few dancers.

461
24:24.680 --> 24:27.280
Meng has already started interrogating them.

462
24:30.550 --> 24:31.350
Where is he?

463
24:34.590 --> 24:35.680
So unlucky.

464
24:35.920 --> 24:37.270
I was hoping the prince

465
24:37.270 --> 24:38.790
would give some reward money,

466
24:38.790 --> 24:40.550
but now there's nothing.

467
24:52.240 --> 24:54.100
You were supposed to be off today.

468
24:54.200 --> 24:55.270
Why did you switch days

469
24:55.270 --> 24:56.330
with Miss Chuntao?

470
24:57.000 --> 24:57.790
I...

471
24:59.750 --> 25:00.550
I...

472
25:01.030 --> 25:02.590
I admire Prince Wenbu of Northern Kun's

473
25:02.590 --> 25:03.590
peerless beauty,

474
25:03.680 --> 25:04.880
and wanted to see him.

475
25:07.590 --> 25:09.250
I'll give you one more chance.

476
25:09.640 --> 25:10.550
Say it again.

477
25:12.510 --> 25:14.570
My brother owes money from gambling,

478
25:14.640 --> 25:16.030
and my family is short of money.

479
25:16.030 --> 25:17.030
So I thought

480
25:17.030 --> 25:18.920
if I could get Prince Wenbu's appreciation,

481
25:18.920 --> 25:20.580
I might get more reward money.

482
25:24.310 --> 25:25.070
Leave.

483
25:33.480 --> 25:34.270
Miss.

484
25:38.310 --> 25:39.110
Miss.

485
25:39.510 --> 25:40.960
As a lady,

486
25:41.000 --> 25:42.310
even if you're angry,

487
25:42.310 --> 25:43.720
you should smile more.

488
25:43.920 --> 25:44.680
Because

489
25:45.310 --> 25:46.640
ladies who love to smile

490
25:46.680 --> 25:48.310
usually don't have bad luck.

491
25:48.510 --> 25:49.720
What is he doing now?

492
26:01.510 --> 26:02.480
Mr. Li.

493
26:03.030 --> 26:05.000
Taking advantage of the investigation to flirt with women.

494
26:05.000 --> 26:06.160
How carefree.

495
26:07.680 --> 26:09.140
Ms. Bai, you are mistaken.

496
26:09.790 --> 26:11.320
I am taking advantage of...

497
26:13.310 --> 26:15.240
the opportunity to sort things out

498
26:15.590 --> 26:16.990
to investigate the case.

499
26:24.160 --> 26:24.960
Miss.

500
26:26.920 --> 26:29.310
Why do you look so familiar?

501
26:32.590 --> 26:33.400
Have we

502
26:34.270 --> 26:35.310
met somewhere

503
26:35.310 --> 26:36.160
before?

504
26:47.480 --> 26:48.270
Zhenzhu.

505
26:49.510 --> 26:52.310
If this Corpse-Dissolving Powder is used on a person,

506
26:52.310 --> 26:54.370
how long at most will it take to take effect?

507
26:54.370 --> 26:55.400
At most the duration of a dance.

508
26:55.400 --> 26:56.160
Otherwise, how could it have

509
26:56.160 --> 26:57.490
the name "Yama's Call"?

510
26:59.510 --> 27:00.720
Before Wenbu died,

511
27:00.790 --> 27:02.390
he happened to watch a dance.

512
27:02.920 --> 27:03.960
Based on the time,

513
27:04.270 --> 27:05.550
the murderer should have

514
27:05.550 --> 27:07.610
poisoned him in the Envoy Residence.

515
27:07.750 --> 27:08.510
After the poison took effect,

516
27:08.510 --> 27:10.640
the scene was sealed off, and no one entered or left.

517
27:10.640 --> 27:11.700
So the murderer...

518
27:15.880 --> 27:17.160
must still be here.

519
27:18.310 --> 27:19.770
Are the dancers suspects?

520
27:21.200 --> 27:22.440
That's why I said,

521
27:22.480 --> 27:23.310
"Leave it to me."

522
27:23.310 --> 27:24.880
A good whipping for each of them,

523
27:24.880 --> 27:27.410
and they'll definitely confess everything.

524
27:37.440 --> 27:38.440
Little Goldfish.

525
27:40.310 --> 27:41.840
I told you I recognized you.

526
27:41.920 --> 27:43.320
I didn't lie to you, did I?

527
27:45.480 --> 27:46.830
Then do you remember me?

528
27:47.400 --> 27:48.640
Young Master Qingyang.

529
27:48.640 --> 27:50.400
You often come with the Crown Prince.

530
27:50.400 --> 27:51.720
Of course, I remember.

531
27:52.400 --> 27:53.920
Young Master Qingyang, do you remember me?

532
27:53.920 --> 27:55.200
Do you remember me, Young Master Qingyang?

533
27:55.200 --> 27:56.920
-Do you remember me? -Do you remember me?

534
27:56.920 --> 27:57.720
Look.

535
27:58.920 --> 28:00.030
What is this?

536
28:00.540 --> 28:01.580
Silver!

537
28:01.610 --> 28:03.060
-Silver! -Silver!

538
28:04.030 --> 28:05.350
Okay, let me show you.

539
28:06.510 --> 28:07.570
I want it. I want it.

540
28:09.440 --> 28:10.510
I want it.

541
28:12.200 --> 28:13.030
Silver.

542
28:20.310 --> 28:21.110
Okay.

543
28:22.720 --> 28:23.880
Don't rush.

544
28:23.880 --> 28:25.480
I'll ask you some questions.

545
28:25.720 --> 28:27.110
If you answer well,

546
28:27.510 --> 28:30.310
there will naturally be no shortage of reward silver.

547
28:30.310 --> 28:31.720
-Thank you, Young Master Qingyang. -Thank you, Young Master Qingyang.

548
28:31.720 --> 28:32.580
Ask us quickly.

549
28:33.070 --> 28:33.960
Let me ask you.

550
28:35.000 --> 28:37.110
Both kind words and silver

551
28:37.110 --> 28:38.640
can achieve the goal.

552
28:39.830 --> 28:41.110
But why are some people

553
28:41.510 --> 28:43.170
always willing to use swords?

554
28:49.480 --> 28:53.610
-Young Master, we'll take our leave. -Young Master, we'll take our leave.

555
28:55.510 --> 28:56.310
Miss,

556
28:56.640 --> 28:58.240
you have quite a few calluses

557
28:58.310 --> 28:59.310
on your hand.

558
29:03.310 --> 29:04.840
What are you doing, My Lord?

559
29:05.240 --> 29:06.030
Sorry.

560
29:07.310 --> 29:08.110
My apology.

561
29:09.680 --> 29:11.030
Mr. Meng, your mind is now

562
29:11.030 --> 29:12.070
full of the case.

563
29:12.640 --> 29:13.440
I guess

564
29:13.920 --> 29:14.750
you thought

565
29:14.750 --> 29:16.270
this lady's calluses

566
29:16.440 --> 29:17.640
were on her thumb web.

567
29:18.200 --> 29:19.880
You suspected she was an assassin

568
29:19.880 --> 29:22.340
who has been wielding swords for a long time.

569
29:22.720 --> 29:24.510
But this lady's calluses

570
29:24.880 --> 29:26.140
are on her fingertips.

571
29:26.920 --> 29:29.780
This is caused by doing manual labor for a long time.

572
29:34.240 --> 29:35.070
Mr. Meng.

573
29:36.240 --> 29:38.070
I have frequented brothels for a long time,

574
29:38.070 --> 29:40.130
often buying some unfortunate women

575
29:40.200 --> 29:41.640
into the Star-Gathering Pavilion

576
29:41.640 --> 29:42.970
to help them start anew.

577
29:44.590 --> 29:45.400
So,

578
29:47.790 --> 29:49.920
I know these ladies better than you do.

579
29:50.240 --> 29:51.920
As for interrogating the dancers,

580
29:51.920 --> 29:53.310
why not leave it to me?

581
30:07.510 --> 30:08.350
It seems

582
30:09.030 --> 30:10.830
we are both unfortunate people.

583
30:11.590 --> 30:13.640
Young Master Qingyang, you're the richest in the world.

584
30:13.640 --> 30:15.240
How can you be like me?

585
30:20.310 --> 30:21.240
Then why don't we

586
30:21.720 --> 30:23.640
have a good talk about

587
30:24.110 --> 30:25.070
what it means to

588
30:25.720 --> 30:28.680
meet by chance without prior acquaintance?

589
30:43.480 --> 30:46.480
I wonder what advice you have, Young Master Qingyang.

590
30:49.210 --> 30:50.450
I also want to ask you

591
30:53.310 --> 30:55.270
why you killed Prince Wenbu.

592
30:56.600 --> 30:58.950
W-What are you talking about?

593
31:00.000 --> 31:01.880
Prince Wenbu had expert guards,

594
31:02.310 --> 31:03.920
and I don't know how to fight.

595
31:05.000 --> 31:06.350
How could I kill him?

596
31:07.640 --> 31:08.440
True.

597
31:09.070 --> 31:10.920
You indeed don't know martial arts,

598
31:10.920 --> 31:12.920
and you don't have calluses on your hands

599
31:12.920 --> 31:14.920
from holding a sword for a long time.

600
31:16.480 --> 31:17.310
But...

601
31:20.480 --> 31:21.510
your fingers

602
31:22.070 --> 31:23.480
are still rough

603
31:24.000 --> 31:25.260
and peeling severely.

604
31:25.510 --> 31:26.200
This is because

605
31:26.200 --> 31:28.240
people who develop poisons for a long time

606
31:28.240 --> 31:29.920
inevitably get poison on their hands

607
31:29.920 --> 31:31.880
and need to wash them frequently.

608
31:36.720 --> 31:37.510
I guess

609
31:38.240 --> 31:40.100
you are an expert in using poison.

610
31:42.310 --> 31:43.110
Not long ago,

611
31:43.790 --> 31:46.070
I came to the Envoy Residence with the Crown Prince.

612
31:46.070 --> 31:47.720
I admired your zither skills

613
31:48.110 --> 31:51.310
and wanted to invite you to the Star-Gathering Pavilion.

614
31:51.480 --> 31:52.270
I offered a price

615
31:52.270 --> 31:54.160
that no one could refuse.

616
31:54.720 --> 31:55.720
But you

617
31:58.510 --> 31:59.720
refused.

618
32:01.030 --> 32:01.830
So,

619
32:02.590 --> 32:04.450
you stayed at the Envoy Residence

620
32:04.720 --> 32:05.880
because there must be something

621
32:05.880 --> 32:07.510
you have to do, right?

622
32:17.880 --> 32:20.340
I didn't expect that my long-planned scheme

623
32:23.680 --> 32:25.960
was exposed by a playboy.

624
32:27.270 --> 32:28.880
It's truly a trick of fate.

625
32:30.640 --> 32:32.770
Young Master Qingyang, you're right.

626
32:33.930 --> 32:35.710
I do have some knowledge

627
32:36.150 --> 32:37.550
of toxicology.

628
32:57.400 --> 32:58.300
Oh no.

629
33:14.920 --> 33:16.450
What is the meaning of this?

630
33:19.510 --> 33:21.710
I was afraid your sword would be too fast

631
33:21.830 --> 33:23.310
and kill the suspect.

632
33:23.720 --> 33:25.780
When the Severe-Cold Sword is drawn,

633
33:25.880 --> 33:27.030
someone must die.

634
33:27.240 --> 33:28.240
Not necessarily.

635
33:31.270 --> 33:32.830
Aren't you an exception?

636
33:38.750 --> 33:39.550
Let's go.

637
33:49.110 --> 33:51.070
My Lords, it's time to eat.

638
33:56.510 --> 33:58.310
Yan, any results yet?

639
33:58.680 --> 34:00.070
Before we even used torture,

640
34:00.070 --> 34:01.600
she confessed everything.

641
34:05.830 --> 34:07.830
This woman has a tragic background.

642
34:08.190 --> 34:09.480
Her father and brothers all died tragically

643
34:09.480 --> 34:11.110
under the iron hooves of Northern Kun.

644
34:11.110 --> 34:12.440
So last year,

645
34:12.440 --> 34:14.320
she sneaked in here as a dancer,

646
34:14.320 --> 34:15.800
waiting for a chance to seek revenge.

647
34:15.800 --> 34:16.860
But unexpectedly,

648
34:17.190 --> 34:18.790
before she could make a move,

649
34:19.070 --> 34:21.030
Prince Wenbu had died.

650
34:21.510 --> 34:22.320
That's all.

651
34:23.920 --> 34:24.960
In that case,

652
34:25.110 --> 34:26.800
detain her in the Divine Constable Bureau

653
34:26.800 --> 34:28.510
for attempted murder pending trial.

654
34:28.510 --> 34:29.320
-Yes. -Yes.

655
34:35.230 --> 34:37.290
Sometimes I really don't understand

656
34:37.670 --> 34:40.630
which is more important,

657
34:41.320 --> 34:42.980
revenge or living a good life.

658
34:46.880 --> 34:48.070
Don't judge others

659
34:49.230 --> 34:51.290
unless you've walked in their shoes.

660
35:12.320 --> 35:13.320
Where is Mr. Meng?

661
35:14.230 --> 35:15.230
Who knows?

662
35:15.280 --> 35:16.230
That ice block

663
35:16.230 --> 35:17.360
is always so aloof.

664
35:18.710 --> 35:20.440
The scene investigation and interrogation

665
35:20.440 --> 35:21.630
yielded nothing.

666
35:22.400 --> 35:23.510
We questioned all suspects,

667
35:23.510 --> 35:24.710
but made no progress.

668
35:25.480 --> 35:26.760
Right after Wenbu died,

669
35:26.760 --> 35:27.320
our people

670
35:27.320 --> 35:28.440
locked down the scene.

671
35:28.440 --> 35:29.920
Everyone and everything was checked.

672
35:29.920 --> 35:31.800
Not even a piece of paper could be thrown out.

673
35:31.800 --> 35:32.960
But we couldn't find any clues

674
35:32.960 --> 35:34.320
on anyone.

675
35:35.110 --> 35:37.040
Could it be that we're looking in the wrong direction,

676
35:37.040 --> 35:38.370
and the murderer

677
35:38.390 --> 35:39.850
is actually from without?

678
35:40.590 --> 35:41.400
Impossible.

679
35:42.800 --> 35:44.230
Why are you so sure?

680
35:46.710 --> 35:47.970
Because of the timing.

681
35:50.440 --> 35:51.360
My Lords,

682
35:51.800 --> 35:52.710
think about it.

683
35:53.320 --> 35:55.980
The Corpse-Dissolving Powder is highly toxic.

684
35:56.110 --> 35:56.960
If

685
35:57.230 --> 35:58.110
Wenbu had been poisoned

686
35:58.110 --> 35:59.480
outside,

687
35:59.710 --> 36:01.280
he would have died

688
36:01.480 --> 36:03.810
before the dancers even started dancing.

689
36:15.190 --> 36:16.030
Ms. Bai,

690
36:17.000 --> 36:18.510
your noodles have been sitting for so long

691
36:18.510 --> 36:19.770
and have gotten soggy.

692
36:19.880 --> 36:21.010
Are they still good?

693
36:22.670 --> 36:24.280
Young Master Qingyang, you're used to fine dining,

694
36:24.280 --> 36:26.940
so naturally, you can't stand this coarse food.

695
36:30.670 --> 36:31.480
I mean,

696
36:31.920 --> 36:34.440
noodles get soggy if left for too long.

697
36:51.710 --> 36:52.880
It's really possible that Wenbu

698
36:52.880 --> 36:54.280
took the poison outside.

699
37:00.480 --> 37:02.210
Noodles get soggy when soaked,

700
37:02.230 --> 37:03.360
and paper wrapped in the stomach for a long time

701
37:03.360 --> 37:04.490
will also dissolve.

702
37:04.590 --> 37:06.070
As long as the murderer used a medicinal film

703
37:06.070 --> 37:08.030
or paper to wrap the powder,

704
37:08.110 --> 37:09.480
let Wenbu swallow it,

705
37:09.710 --> 37:10.510
and then...

706
37:20.280 --> 37:21.230
This way,

707
37:21.230 --> 37:22.480
if the timing was calculated well,

708
37:22.480 --> 37:24.070
even if Wenbu took the poison

709
37:24.070 --> 37:25.190
before coming to the Envoy Residence,

710
37:25.190 --> 37:27.120
he could last until after the dance

711
37:27.280 --> 37:30.080
when the powder finally dissolved in his stomach.

712
37:33.280 --> 37:34.070
So,

713
37:34.670 --> 37:36.960
the murderer is indeed from without.

714
37:46.880 --> 37:47.880
Still not right.

715
37:56.000 --> 37:56.760
If the murderer

716
37:56.760 --> 37:59.320
wanted to create the effect of a murder warning,

717
37:59.320 --> 38:01.070
he must have calculated exactly

718
38:01.070 --> 38:03.510
when Wenbu took the poison and when it would act,

719
38:03.510 --> 38:05.070
without any error.

720
38:06.320 --> 38:08.640
If the murderer was outside,

721
38:08.670 --> 38:09.880
there's no way

722
38:09.880 --> 38:11.880
he could calculate it so precisely.

723
38:12.000 --> 38:14.510
So is the murderer outside

724
38:14.880 --> 38:16.280
or inside?

725
38:24.630 --> 38:26.630
There's another suspicious point.

726
38:26.880 --> 38:28.080
Generally speaking,

727
38:28.400 --> 38:29.530
destroying a corpse

728
38:29.760 --> 38:30.510
is to prevent people

729
38:30.510 --> 38:31.960
from finding it.

730
38:32.230 --> 38:32.960
But the murderer

731
38:32.960 --> 38:34.440
has already murdered someone

732
38:34.440 --> 38:35.360
in plain sight.

733
38:35.800 --> 38:36.880
Then why

734
38:37.710 --> 38:39.150
dissolve the corpse?

735
38:40.710 --> 38:42.880
Is it purely to scare people?

736
38:46.280 --> 38:47.070
Also,

737
38:48.110 --> 38:50.640
since the murderer is so precise with poison,

738
38:51.320 --> 38:52.110
any poison

739
38:52.110 --> 38:53.320
would do.

740
38:53.630 --> 38:55.110
Why must he choose

741
38:55.110 --> 38:56.280
such an expensive

742
38:56.320 --> 38:58.190
and easily traceable

743
38:58.190 --> 38:59.790
Corpse-Dissolving Powder?

744
39:01.920 --> 39:03.960
Not bad, newbie.

745
39:04.280 --> 39:05.840
Your analysis makes sense.

746
39:08.840 --> 39:12.360
-Lord Constable Iron, I'm... -Then what, in your view, is the cause?
